{"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11959210713704427,"x":0.073948802288020421,"h":0.015599309204604839,"y":0.040165461661803348,"c":1},{"x":0.076031077617780482,"y":0.083265251536894014,"h":0.017712640818493663,"w":0.69980265299479161,"c":1,"t":"winter clothes, knitting may save you a lot of money. And the results of knitting your own"},{"h":0.018571509348910942,"y":0.097855215237668491,"c":1,"t":"clothes can be very rewarding, even though the skills you need to get going are really quite","w":0.72245605468750007,"x":0.078066934886655115},{"t":"basic and the financial outlay is minimal.","x":0.076131684684676765,"y":0.1162790696335364,"c":1,"w":0.32304527282714846,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"But the more significant benefits in today's world are to do with well-being. In a world where","x":0.078071894023008112,"y":0.13587212657224268,"w":0.7245154825846355,"h":0.017565107177087369,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.72241261800130208,"h":0.016933086763703198,"y":0.15238609567872141,"x":0.076052345539698085,"t":"it's estimated that we spend up to nine hours a day online, doing something with our hands"},{"w":0.73676122029622404,"x":0.076064973834722688,"c":1,"t":"that is craft-based makes us feel good. It releases us from the stress of a technological, fast-","y":0.16799793618599579,"h":0.016079925676397488},{"h":0.013081394460653373,"c":1,"y":0.18604651190848143,"t":"paced life.","w":0.084362138112386062,"x":0.078189301751420123},{"x":0.84567901294922387,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.097383720771799465,"c":1,"t":"Q35","w":0.037037035624186143},{"h":0.016700841231958252,"t":"Now, let's look back a bit to early knitting activities. In fact, no one really knows when knitting first","x":0.08015445913019438,"c":1,"y":0.22923863615596507,"w":0.74093785603841145},{"y":0.24356146535765966,"w":0.70806915283203131,"c":1,"x":0.078062522336666024,"t":"began, but archaeological remains have disclosed plenty of information for us to think about.","h":0.01847224353480259},{"h":0.016486977800744373,"y":0.26809280173074712,"c":1,"t":"One of the interesting things about knitting is that the earliest pieces of clothing that have","x":0.080154786398469471,"w":0.70390691121419269},{"w":0.73477442423502604,"y":0.28277023052982531,"h":0.017340319737950027,"t":"been found suggest that most of the items produced were round rather than flat. Discoveries","x":0.078086224832399673,"c":1},{"x":0.078116386445574518,"t":"from the 3rd and 4th centuries in Egypt show that things like socks and gloves, that were","y":0.29912308184778147,"w":0.7038565572102865,"h":0.016004563501220925,"c":1},{"h":0.018921738659394838,"t":"needed to keep hands and feet warm, were knitted in one piece using four or five needles.","x":0.078069358565193259,"y":0.31325474692971522,"c":1,"w":0.72038619995117192},{"h":0.018282611743581034,"x":0.078079283458133614,"t":"That's very different from most knitting patterns today, which only require two. What's","y":0.3296697113355207,"c":1,"w":0.6751337687174479},{"w":0.71019424438476564,"h":0.02025523146414776,"t":"more, the very first needles people used were hand carved out of wood and other natural","y":0.3421225670319199,"x":0.078026530158207277,"c":1},{"w":0.72653971354166669,"c":1,"t":"materials, like bone, whereas today's needles are largely made of steel or plastic and make","h":0.017302832137288782,"x":0.07808968569660607,"y":0.35996195797782771},{"c":1,"x":0.076008943782615385,"w":0.72863210042317716,"t":"that characteristic clicking sound when someone's using them. Ancient people knitted using","h":0.019090895096741778,"y":0.3745273430163335},{"x":0.078110337459309093,"t":"yarns made from linen, hemp, cotton and wool, and these were often very rough on the skin.","y":0.39168645891517384,"w":0.73471623738606773,"h":0.017585553887033534,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.40688219244448165,"x":0.080173603611516361,"w":0.7100504557291667,"t":"The spinning wheel, which allowed people to make finer yarns and produce much greater","h":0.016529983008287008},{"w":0.72461873372395835,"c":1,"h":0.021089317941834107,"t":"quantities of them, led to the dominance of wool in the knitting industry - often favoured for","x":0.078019109693017966,"y":0.42036377635741395},{"y":0.43930873510462765,"h":0.015401150509100736,"x":0.075858792682945056,"t":"its warmth.","c":1,"w":0.095305455525716135},{"c":1,"y":0.46027841102890832,"t":"Another interesting fact about knitting is that because it was practised in so many parts of the","w":0.73888478597005214,"h":0.017223479469757552,"x":0.08014751952549394},{"c":1,"t":"world for so many purposes, regional differences in style developed. This visual identity has","h":0.019943111496061539,"x":0.078073060749986115,"y":0.47557690307731626,"w":0.7307039896647135},{"y":0.49100339410437366,"h":0.016932250473328025,"w":0.7224253845214843,"t":"allowed researchers to match bits of knitted clothing that have been unearthed over time to","x":0.080147352497307811,"c":1},{"x":0.078062628151597549,"y":0.5071463921587499,"w":0.54549402872721353,"t":"the region from which the wearer came or the job that he or she did.","h":0.018556228094022353,"c":1},{"t":"As l've mentioned, knitting offered people from poor communities a way of making extra","c":1,"x":0.080171589346582736,"y":0.53006393050863587,"w":0.69768819173177077,"h":0.01627213935267946},{"y":0.54460283579306701,"x":0.082187340226973146,"w":0.73891153971354162,"c":1,"t":"money while doing other tasks. For many centuries, it seems, men, women and children took","h":0.01924194632486409},{"y":0.55974567359077831,"x":0.08008060440993138,"t":"every opportunity to knit, for example, while watching over sheep, walking to market or riding","w":0.73694839477539065,"h":0.020777267617808626,"c":1},{"h":0.015861663436440354,"c":1,"t":"in boats. So, let's move on to take a ...","y":0.5778460785521099,"x":0.082166050512996053,"w":0.30887992858886715},{"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.28197674399581829,"t":"Q36","x":0.8477366261979663,"h":0.013081395583944833},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q37","x":0.84773662634428548,"y":0.34302325556558577,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"c":1,"x":0.84773662642658998,"t":"Q38","y":0.38953488400150471,"h":0.013081394460653373,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"x":0.8497942392866723,"t":"Q39","w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.47529069751598563},{"t":"Q40","y":0.5595930230973809,"c":1,"x":0.84979423929953246,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"y":0.91424418590781964,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"114","w":0.037037035624186199,"x":0.084362140515188436,"c":1},{"w":0.25061218261718743,"h":0.02906125116966074,"y":0.9561987124207002,"c":1,"x":0.71922402793715989,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3396,"w":2400}